\centering
\caption{Coercion strategies for different type system features}\label{tab:coercion-strategies}
\begin{tabular}{p{3.5cm}p{3.5cm}p{4.5cm}}
\hline
\textbf{Feature} & \textbf{Coercion} & \textbf{Optimization} \\
\hline
Numeric widening & Convert representation & Fuse conversions \\
Width subtyping & Project fields & Inline projections \\
Depth subtyping & Coerce fields recursively & Flatten coercions \\
