\subsection{Specialization with Coercions}\label{sec:spec-coercions}

When a polymorphic function is specialized for a concrete type, the coercions can often be eliminated:

\begin{verbatim}
  -- Generic (with coercions):
  let max : Num -> Num -> Num = fun a b ->
    if coerce_to_int(a) > coerce_to_int(b) then a else b

  -- Specialized for Int (coercions eliminated):
  let max_int : Int -> Int -> Int = fun a b ->
    if a > b then a else b
  -- The coerce_to_int calls are eliminated because the type is already Int
\end{verbatim}

